1
00:00:12,530 --> 00:00:20,580
♪From primal chaos to the starry sky♪

2
00:00:20,580 --> 00:00:28,340
♪In the whole world,
we shall hold the balance♪

3
00:00:44,920 --> 00:00:46,940
♪The cauldron tempers divine blades♪

4
00:00:46,940 --> 00:00:50,810
♪The furnace refines the empty void♪

5
00:00:52,820 --> 00:00:54,930
♪The Way is in mystic fate♪

6
00:00:54,930 --> 00:00:58,720
♪Be brave enough to split
the primal chaos wide open♪

7
00:01:36,380 --> 00:01:37,620
[Pull Strings]

8
00:01:37,620 --> 00:01:39,380
[Adapted from the novel
by Yan Gui Zheng Zhuan]

9
00:01:40,900 --> 00:01:44,200
[Marriage Division, Celestial Court]

10
00:01:44,200 --> 00:01:51,210
♪Birds in the trees fly in pairs♪

11
00:01:51,310 --> 00:01:55,050
Liu Yan'er, Wang Qi.

12
00:01:55,050 --> 00:01:56,070
[Liu Yan'er Wang Qi]

13
00:01:56,070 --> 00:01:58,770
I'll bind you two tighter.

14
00:01:58,790 --> 00:02:02,490
May you grow old together.

15
00:02:02,640 --> 00:02:07,290
♪Green hills and waters smile♪

16
00:02:09,310 --> 00:02:11,060
Another pair made.

17
00:02:11,310 --> 00:02:14,380
Fate sees all. Fate sees all!

18
00:02:18,630 --> 00:02:19,410
[Grand Mage of Voidcity]
Grand Mage.

19
00:02:19,410 --> 00:02:20,660
[Supreme Elder's first disciple,
Three Sects of the Way]

20
00:02:21,000 --> 00:02:21,780
Old man,

21
00:02:22,360 --> 00:02:23,690
I just had a dream.

22
00:02:24,030 --> 00:02:25,540
I dreamed that by Mentor's order,

23
00:02:25,560 --> 00:02:28,060
I came here to boost human procreation.

24
00:02:28,080 --> 00:02:30,410
The results are quite pleasing.

25
00:02:30,960 --> 00:02:33,410
Grand Mage, this is no dream.

26
00:02:33,560 --> 00:02:36,500
Perhaps you are actually here for this,

27
00:02:36,840 --> 00:02:39,690
but you fell asleep after arriving

28
00:02:39,710 --> 00:02:41,100
at Ascendance Sect, East Land.

29
00:02:43,840 --> 00:02:45,340
Then I'll take a short rest and return.

30
00:02:45,360 --> 00:02:46,660
Grand Mage, Grand Mage.

31
00:02:46,910 --> 00:02:48,820
You've already taken three naps.

32
00:02:49,120 --> 00:02:51,450
Please, do some proper work.

33
00:02:51,630 --> 00:02:53,730
If this delays
the Human Sect's marriages,

34
00:02:53,750 --> 00:02:55,570
Eastwood Duke won't let me off.

35
00:02:56,030 --> 00:02:57,290
Eastwood Duke?

36
00:02:59,030 --> 00:02:59,780
Eastwood Duke is no trouble.

37
00:03:00,310 --> 00:03:01,100
Grand Mage, Grand Mage.

38
00:03:01,120 --> 00:03:01,780
Please, please.

39
00:03:01,800 --> 00:03:02,890
Please, look.

40
00:03:04,150 --> 00:03:04,890
This is

41
00:03:04,910 --> 00:03:07,100
the Book of Marriages
of Ascendance Sect.

42
00:03:07,120 --> 00:03:07,890
Please, take a look.

43
00:03:09,750 --> 00:03:10,890
On this

44
00:03:11,120 --> 00:03:14,660
are recorded all birth dates

45
00:03:14,710 --> 00:03:16,100
and names

46
00:03:16,120 --> 00:03:17,570
of the couples.

47
00:03:26,470 --> 00:03:29,100
I never imagined
that over these centuries,

48
00:03:29,430 --> 00:03:30,820
our Ascendance Sect
would have so many couples.

49
00:03:30,960 --> 00:03:31,780
No, no.

50
00:03:32,710 --> 00:03:33,660
This right here

51
00:03:33,680 --> 00:03:35,820
is just from the past three months.

52
00:03:38,030 --> 00:03:38,540
This

53
00:03:39,400 --> 00:03:40,980
is from the past several centuries.

54
00:03:40,980 --> 00:03:42,260
[Book of Marriages of Ascendance Sect]

55
00:03:45,520 --> 00:03:46,290
That's it?

56
00:03:54,430 --> 00:03:55,500
Were you dozing off?

57
00:03:55,710 --> 00:03:57,060
I wouldn't dare.

58
00:03:57,360 --> 00:03:58,730
It's empty inside.

59
00:03:58,960 --> 00:04:00,690
Over the past centuries,

60
00:04:00,750 --> 00:04:03,380
your Ascendance Sect hasn't had
a single match.

61
00:04:03,680 --> 00:04:06,690
But in just the past three months,

62
00:04:06,710 --> 00:04:08,890
480 couples have formed.

63
00:04:09,000 --> 00:04:11,100
480 couples...

64
00:04:11,870 --> 00:04:13,820
Ones, tens, hundreds, thousands.

65
00:04:15,560 --> 00:04:16,290
Four hundred and eighty.

66
00:04:16,310 --> 00:04:17,580
Grand Mage, you're so clever!

67
00:04:18,310 --> 00:04:19,730
From what I've observed,

68
00:04:19,750 --> 00:04:21,140
all these love matches

69
00:04:21,160 --> 00:04:23,020
come from a single new sprout.

70
00:04:23,160 --> 00:04:26,100
This sprout has sparked many matches,

71
00:04:26,120 --> 00:04:28,370
yet it itself remains untouched.

72
00:04:28,510 --> 00:04:31,220
He's got three admirers.

73
00:04:31,240 --> 00:04:31,980
Admirers?

74
00:04:37,510 --> 00:04:38,810
But he rejected all of them.

75
00:04:38,830 --> 00:04:40,900
This is not an easy thing.

76
00:04:40,920 --> 00:04:42,020
The admirers are trying.

77
00:04:42,310 --> 00:04:42,980
Look.

78
00:04:54,270 --> 00:04:56,250
I think this virtuous talent

79
00:04:56,560 --> 00:04:58,490
must be calm and self-restraint.

80
00:04:58,800 --> 00:04:59,490
That's why

81
00:04:59,510 --> 00:05:02,490
he turned down three fine matches.

82
00:05:04,430 --> 00:05:06,290
How amusing!

83
00:05:07,750 --> 00:05:09,700
Why not invite the Moon Elder

84
00:05:09,870 --> 00:05:11,100
to bring them together?

85
00:05:12,360 --> 00:05:13,170
Grand Mage,

86
00:05:14,480 --> 00:05:16,780
actually, I am the Moon Elder.

87
00:05:17,040 --> 00:05:17,930
You are the Moon Elder?

88
00:05:17,950 --> 00:05:19,020
So, you're the Moon Elder!

89
00:05:21,000 --> 00:05:21,780
Nice to meet you.

90
00:05:22,680 --> 00:05:23,700
How nice indeed.

91
00:05:23,950 --> 00:05:25,250
If you're the Moon Elder,

92
00:05:25,310 --> 00:05:27,220
why don't you just tie them together?

93
00:05:27,510 --> 00:05:29,220
That won't do, that won't do.

94
00:05:29,480 --> 00:05:31,290
The Marriage Division can only assist

95
00:05:31,630 --> 00:05:33,850
the marriage destinies
of all living beings.

96
00:05:33,950 --> 00:05:35,250
It must not be forced.

97
00:05:38,630 --> 00:05:40,460
I never imagined
that in our Way lineage,

98
00:05:41,120 --> 00:05:42,490
there is such a fascinating person.

99
00:05:42,720 --> 00:05:44,610
What is this person's name?

100
00:05:46,510 --> 00:05:47,490
Li Changshou,

101
00:05:47,750 --> 00:05:48,980
Jade Division,

102
00:05:49,680 --> 00:05:50,490
Ascendance Sect.

103
00:05:53,100 --> 00:05:55,380
[Li Changshou]

104
00:05:56,420 --> 00:05:59,340
[Episode 5]

105
00:06:09,510 --> 00:06:11,100
You still can't channel your power?

106
00:06:11,480 --> 00:06:12,900
Every time I try to channel it,

107
00:06:13,270 --> 00:06:15,220
I recall Yuan Qing's words that day.

108
00:06:20,160 --> 00:06:21,700
What did Yuan Qing say?

109
00:06:22,560 --> 00:06:23,340
He said

110
00:06:23,920 --> 00:06:26,020
that I don't know what this sword means,

111
00:06:26,040 --> 00:06:27,490
nor why I wield it.

112
00:06:27,920 --> 00:06:30,100
This question has been troubling me,

113
00:06:30,630 --> 00:06:32,220
keeping me from using this new sword

114
00:06:32,240 --> 00:06:33,250
to release my power.

115
00:06:35,120 --> 00:06:35,900
It's alright.

116
00:06:36,240 --> 00:06:37,050
Maybe

117
00:06:37,070 --> 00:06:39,290
this sword just isn't right for you.

118
00:06:42,430 --> 00:06:43,850
You have the Firescale Sword, right?

119
00:06:44,430 --> 00:06:46,900
The edge and tip are broken.
I buried it.

120
00:06:47,040 --> 00:06:47,810
You buried it?

121
00:06:49,120 --> 00:06:50,170
Let it be buried then.

122
00:06:50,480 --> 00:06:52,370
You'll surely find a better one.

123
00:06:58,630 --> 00:06:59,610
If the heart is there,

124
00:07:01,040 --> 00:07:02,170
the sword is there.

125
00:07:03,630 --> 00:07:04,490
Please take your leave.

126
00:07:05,510 --> 00:07:06,700
Heart...

127
00:07:08,510 --> 00:07:09,140
Senior,

128
00:07:09,160 --> 00:07:10,490
isn't that a bit too dismissive?

129
00:07:10,920 --> 00:07:11,810
She's venomous.

130
00:07:11,920 --> 00:07:13,340
She's worse than the Gnatsting Needle.

131
00:07:13,360 --> 00:07:14,580
We have to steer clear.

132
00:07:14,750 --> 00:07:15,580
I understand.

133
00:07:18,070 --> 00:07:18,900
You even understand that?

134
00:07:20,240 --> 00:07:22,610
Your sword isn't tangible.

135
00:07:22,720 --> 00:07:24,700
It's a Qi refiner's inner righteousness.

136
00:07:24,830 --> 00:07:26,900
The sword-bearer relies
not on the blade,

137
00:07:26,950 --> 00:07:28,370
but on a righteous spirit.

138
00:07:29,070 --> 00:07:30,660
Your lesson is spot on.

139
00:07:30,870 --> 00:07:32,490
I'm truly convinced.

140
00:07:40,870 --> 00:07:42,100
This is my junior. Ask her.

141
00:07:42,120 --> 00:07:43,050
I'll leave her to you.

142
00:07:43,050 --> 00:07:44,060
[Hall of United Spirits]

143
00:07:45,120 --> 00:07:46,020
Senior, he...

144
00:07:48,310 --> 00:07:49,100
Senior...

145
00:07:51,240 --> 00:07:52,930
He's just like that.

146
00:07:52,950 --> 00:07:55,020
He'll chat and then suddenly scowl.

147
00:07:56,120 --> 00:07:57,100
Once you've spent more time with him,

148
00:07:57,120 --> 00:07:58,290
you'll surely dislike it.

149
00:07:59,430 --> 00:08:01,810
Kindred souls value a knowing heart.

150
00:08:02,480 --> 00:08:05,100
So carefree and noble.

151
00:08:05,160 --> 00:08:07,980
Truly a lofty vision, a broad mind.

152
00:08:11,240 --> 00:08:12,020
Senior Youqin,

153
00:08:12,270 --> 00:08:13,980
you know so many idioms!

154
00:08:15,120 --> 00:08:15,980
Just a little.

155
00:08:17,310 --> 00:08:18,100
Junior,

156
00:08:18,560 --> 00:08:21,410
may I come visit often?

157
00:08:21,680 --> 00:08:22,290
Often?

158
00:08:24,040 --> 00:08:24,700
Look at me.

159
00:08:24,720 --> 00:08:26,050
Every day, I have to sweep, mop,

160
00:08:26,070 --> 00:08:27,100
[Hall of United Spirits]
and wipe tables.

161
00:08:27,120 --> 00:08:28,460
I lit all those candles, you know.

162
00:08:28,750 --> 00:08:31,020
I'm so tired my back is killing me.

163
00:08:31,360 --> 00:08:34,980
You gotta pay me for all this work.

164
00:08:37,080 --> 00:08:38,980
Fifty a day.

165
00:08:42,120 --> 00:08:42,890
One hundred.

166
00:08:47,440 --> 00:08:48,300
I don't have change.

167
00:08:48,480 --> 00:08:50,770
How about I pay for fifty years upfront?

168
00:08:54,360 --> 00:08:55,770
Forget spirit stones; it's no big deal.

169
00:08:55,790 --> 00:08:56,610
It's all the same.

170
00:08:56,630 --> 00:08:57,890
But our division

171
00:08:57,910 --> 00:08:59,700
hasn't had an outsider in years.

172
00:09:00,960 --> 00:09:01,530
Jiu...

173
00:09:01,910 --> 00:09:02,890
Aunt Jiu Jiu.

174
00:09:04,910 --> 00:09:06,060
Is Changshou here?

175
00:09:06,080 --> 00:09:07,300
Does he have a project or something

176
00:09:07,320 --> 00:09:08,460
that needs my help?

177
00:09:09,240 --> 00:09:10,010
He...

178
00:09:10,320 --> 00:09:11,300
He went out.

179
00:09:12,270 --> 00:09:13,820
Senior sure loves giving orders.

180
00:09:13,960 --> 00:09:15,130
Aunt Jiu Jiu lives for her wine.

181
00:09:15,390 --> 00:09:16,730
With wine, she'll gladly help.

182
00:09:17,440 --> 00:09:20,060
Did she pay spirit stones too?

183
00:09:22,000 --> 00:09:22,770
She...

184
00:09:23,320 --> 00:09:24,100
She...

185
00:09:25,270 --> 00:09:26,700
Isn't she here to help?

186
00:09:26,720 --> 00:09:29,250
She's paying with labor.

187
00:09:30,120 --> 00:09:30,610
Right.

188
00:09:34,550 --> 00:09:35,490
Aunt, over there.

189
00:09:35,870 --> 00:09:37,100
A bit to your left. There.

190
00:09:37,390 --> 00:09:38,180
[South Qian]
Three pieces.

191
00:09:39,200 --> 00:09:39,700
Right.

192
00:09:43,510 --> 00:09:44,850
Three more pieces on the right.

193
00:09:47,870 --> 00:09:49,010
And in front of you.

194
00:09:49,030 --> 00:09:50,220
[Five, Heaven, Ten, Earth]
Three pieces there.

195
00:09:55,150 --> 00:09:56,490
Line them up a little more.

196
00:09:57,000 --> 00:09:57,770
All right, all right.

197
00:10:04,630 --> 00:10:06,820
Li Changshou!

198
00:10:07,550 --> 00:10:08,530
Keep going.

199
00:10:09,030 --> 00:10:10,010
Yes.

200
00:10:19,320 --> 00:10:20,890
I'm worn out.

201
00:10:22,440 --> 00:10:23,490
You're amazing.

202
00:10:23,840 --> 00:10:25,610
Three ten-thousandths done.

203
00:10:25,630 --> 00:10:26,580
What did you say?

204
00:10:26,790 --> 00:10:27,610
Li Changshou,

205
00:10:27,790 --> 00:10:29,220
you call this a small task?

206
00:10:29,550 --> 00:10:30,490
28 binding arrays.

207
00:10:30,510 --> 00:10:31,530
76 hidden nodes.

208
00:10:31,550 --> 00:10:33,220
Purplegold Array Plate,
Perpetual Motion Millstone.

209
00:10:33,240 --> 00:10:34,890
Even the sect's grand array
isn't this complete.

210
00:10:34,910 --> 00:10:35,820
What are you really planning?

211
00:10:36,030 --> 00:10:37,730
How could it rival the grand array?

212
00:10:38,030 --> 00:10:40,370
I merely seek some convenience.

213
00:10:40,390 --> 00:10:41,700
For the Sky-Scraping Vine,

214
00:10:42,000 --> 00:10:43,340
I crossed a powerful figure.

215
00:10:43,390 --> 00:10:44,730
I have to be prepared.

216
00:10:45,550 --> 00:10:47,060
Why bring this trouble to me

217
00:10:47,080 --> 00:10:48,180
when I abstain from wine??

218
00:10:48,200 --> 00:10:49,010
Heavens.

219
00:10:49,080 --> 00:10:50,580
Are you trying to end me?

220
00:10:50,600 --> 00:10:52,180
I know quitting wine is hard.

221
00:10:52,440 --> 00:10:53,460
Nonsense.

222
00:10:53,480 --> 00:10:58,100
This is worse
than getting struck by lightning.

223
00:11:11,870 --> 00:11:12,820
I can't touch it.

224
00:11:13,600 --> 00:11:14,580
I've quit drinking.

225
00:11:14,790 --> 00:11:16,580
Uncle, this isn't alcohol.

226
00:11:16,960 --> 00:11:19,580
This is my exclusive original creation:

227
00:11:19,600 --> 00:11:20,890
Captivating Brew.

228
00:11:21,360 --> 00:11:24,010
The perfect substitute.
Satisfaction guaranteed.

229
00:11:26,960 --> 00:11:29,420
I still can't touch it.

230
00:11:37,870 --> 00:11:38,650
Changshou,

231
00:11:39,750 --> 00:11:40,940
from today on,

232
00:11:41,240 --> 00:11:42,420
we'll each use our own titles.

233
00:11:43,840 --> 00:11:44,980
You call me Aunt,

234
00:11:45,630 --> 00:11:46,820
and I'll call you Brother.

235
00:11:48,080 --> 00:11:49,580
Brother? Let's skip that.

236
00:11:50,240 --> 00:11:51,370
But lately,

237
00:11:51,600 --> 00:11:53,820
I've been busy with preparations.

238
00:11:54,200 --> 00:11:55,370
I'm anxious to advance my cultivation.

239
00:11:55,440 --> 00:11:56,730
As for these physical tasks...

240
00:11:58,360 --> 00:11:59,130
I'll take care of them.

241
00:11:59,240 --> 00:12:00,820
Leave it all to me.

242
00:12:01,270 --> 00:12:02,180
Rest assured.

243
00:12:14,840 --> 00:12:15,610
Grand Mage,

244
00:12:15,870 --> 00:12:17,820
with all this sweet talk,

245
00:12:18,480 --> 00:12:20,580
how could he resist?

246
00:12:23,480 --> 00:12:24,300
It seems

247
00:12:25,750 --> 00:12:27,370
that to enlighten that stubborn stone,

248
00:12:27,390 --> 00:12:29,890
we must rely on the Tree of Yearning.

249
00:12:31,080 --> 00:12:32,130
But

250
00:12:32,480 --> 00:12:34,420
for a trivial mortal romance,

251
00:12:34,600 --> 00:12:36,220
this office has no precedent

252
00:12:36,440 --> 00:12:38,820
to use such a sacred object.

253
00:12:39,360 --> 00:12:40,130
Grand Mage,

254
00:12:40,670 --> 00:12:41,820
what do you think?

255
00:12:41,870 --> 00:12:42,890
I think

256
00:12:43,270 --> 00:12:46,530
precedents are meant to be broken.

257
00:12:47,550 --> 00:12:48,580
Look at the three...

258
00:12:49,630 --> 00:12:50,420
Three stars.

259
00:12:50,440 --> 00:12:51,340
Three admirers.

260
00:12:51,360 --> 00:12:52,420
Yeah, three pillars.

261
00:12:52,790 --> 00:12:54,530
It was heaven's will, after all.

262
00:12:54,550 --> 00:12:55,820
We must not waste it.

263
00:12:56,270 --> 00:12:57,220
Moreover,

264
00:12:57,440 --> 00:12:59,010
this is for the Human Clan's prosperity.

265
00:13:00,630 --> 00:13:01,420
It's understandable.

266
00:13:02,200 --> 00:13:02,980
Grand Mage,

267
00:13:03,440 --> 00:13:04,820
with your words,

268
00:13:06,030 --> 00:13:07,490
I will dare to act on it.

269
00:13:20,320 --> 00:13:21,100
Go!

270
00:13:22,500 --> 00:13:25,420
[Hall of United Spirits]

271
00:13:56,840 --> 00:13:57,820
An illusion.

272
00:14:00,270 --> 00:14:02,010
Such a real illusion.

273
00:14:03,670 --> 00:14:05,420
Could it be Fairy Yunxiao?

274
00:14:07,390 --> 00:14:09,530
Just for a piece of Sky-Scraping Vine,

275
00:14:09,550 --> 00:14:11,130
she wants to break my cultivation?

276
00:14:11,870 --> 00:14:13,220
How can she do that?

277
00:14:13,390 --> 00:14:15,370
Here goes the Everlasting Bond.

278
00:14:17,180 --> 00:14:18,600
[Lan Ling'e]

279
00:14:18,600 --> 00:14:19,370
Senior.

280
00:14:23,000 --> 00:14:24,060
Senior.

281
00:14:29,200 --> 00:14:29,980
Senior.

282
00:14:33,630 --> 00:14:34,890
What kind of twisted thought is this?

283
00:14:35,270 --> 00:14:36,220
Illusion, disperse!

284
00:14:36,240 --> 00:14:36,890
Break!

285
00:14:40,030 --> 00:14:41,700
Everlasting Bond!

286
00:14:43,980 --> 00:14:45,140
[Youqin Xuanya]

287
00:14:45,270 --> 00:14:45,940
Senior.

288
00:14:54,440 --> 00:14:55,490
Senior Changshou,

289
00:14:56,390 --> 00:14:57,980
if I had a boat ticket,

290
00:14:59,080 --> 00:15:00,530
would you come with me?

291
00:15:01,270 --> 00:15:02,220
Not a chance.

292
00:15:02,870 --> 00:15:03,650
Break!

293
00:15:03,940 --> 00:15:06,370
♪I grasp the vast firmament♪

294
00:15:06,370 --> 00:15:08,120
♪Karma never falls empty♪

295
00:15:09,390 --> 00:15:09,890
I...

296
00:15:10,960 --> 00:15:12,100
Everlasting Bond!

297
00:15:13,180 --> 00:15:14,300
[Jiu Jiu]

298
00:15:14,910 --> 00:15:16,010
Changshou.

299
00:15:29,240 --> 00:15:30,460
Changshou.

300
00:15:31,200 --> 00:15:32,130
Do you want to go for a ride?

301
00:15:35,440 --> 00:15:36,220
Break!

302
00:15:40,000 --> 00:15:41,100
You brat.

303
00:15:41,630 --> 00:15:43,010
I don't believe it.

304
00:15:43,960 --> 00:15:44,850
Alright, that's enough.

305
00:15:44,870 --> 00:15:46,250
Stop embarrassing yourself

306
00:15:46,270 --> 00:15:47,420
before the Grand Mage.

307
00:15:47,440 --> 00:15:48,220
Eastwood Duke.

308
00:15:48,390 --> 00:15:48,850
You...

309
00:15:50,480 --> 00:15:51,250
Grand Mage.

310
00:15:52,080 --> 00:15:53,370
Look at yourself.

311
00:15:53,390 --> 00:15:54,730
I was just about to praise you.

312
00:15:54,750 --> 00:15:56,530
The Marriage Division's results
have soared lately.

313
00:15:56,550 --> 00:15:58,340
I thought you'd finally improved.

314
00:15:58,360 --> 00:15:59,580
I never thought
you couldn't even handle

315
00:15:59,600 --> 00:16:00,420
such a small matter.

316
00:16:02,440 --> 00:16:04,340
Eastwood Duke, what brings you here?

317
00:16:04,360 --> 00:16:05,610
How could I not come?

318
00:16:06,080 --> 00:16:07,010
Put some effort in.

319
00:16:07,480 --> 00:16:08,820
Don't let the Grand Mage of Voidcity

320
00:16:08,840 --> 00:16:10,010
make a mockery of our Celestial Court.

321
00:16:10,030 --> 00:16:11,220
Put some effort in?

322
00:16:11,240 --> 00:16:12,010
But he...

323
00:16:12,030 --> 00:16:12,770
Back off.

324
00:16:12,790 --> 00:16:13,770
This... he...

325
00:16:21,270 --> 00:16:22,100
Grand Mage.

326
00:16:23,600 --> 00:16:24,890
You be careful too.

327
00:16:26,550 --> 00:16:27,130
You...

328
00:16:27,750 --> 00:16:29,100
Three steps back.

329
00:16:44,960 --> 00:16:46,420
As expected of the immortals.

330
00:16:46,440 --> 00:16:48,130
They saw through my fear of karma,

331
00:16:48,150 --> 00:16:49,180
hitting me where it hurts.

332
00:16:50,510 --> 00:16:51,550
Hey.

333
00:16:53,550 --> 00:16:55,130
No gifts this holiday.

334
00:16:55,960 --> 00:16:58,370
Let's just spend some time together.

335
00:16:59,000 --> 00:17:01,010
Just open your eyes and look at me.

336
00:17:01,910 --> 00:17:03,650
I don't believe
you have no feelings for me.

337
00:17:04,550 --> 00:17:05,810
See you tomorrow.

338
00:17:05,830 --> 00:17:07,380
See you every day.

339
00:17:10,160 --> 00:17:11,620
Immortals, your move is formidable.

340
00:17:11,790 --> 00:17:13,900
Bet I still have my trump card.

341
00:17:15,260 --> 00:17:17,780
[Lifespan Filter:
Portrait of Old Beauties]

342
00:17:22,350 --> 00:17:25,090
Flowers fade; all must age.

343
00:17:25,960 --> 00:17:28,900
Greed, anger, folly, love,
do not bother me.

344
00:17:31,480 --> 00:17:32,250
Break!

345
00:17:38,880 --> 00:17:39,660
Eastwood Duke.

346
00:17:39,680 --> 00:17:40,940
Eastwood Duke, are you alright?

347
00:17:45,720 --> 00:17:46,490
Eastwood Duke.

348
00:17:46,790 --> 00:17:47,770
Are you alright, Eastwood Duke?

349
00:17:48,480 --> 00:17:49,460
Are you alright, Eastwood Duke?

350
00:17:50,790 --> 00:17:52,010
His aspiration for the Way

351
00:17:52,480 --> 00:17:54,250
is simply indestructible.

352
00:17:54,680 --> 00:17:56,050
A rarity for all ages.

353
00:17:56,200 --> 00:17:56,860
How admirable.

354
00:17:57,720 --> 00:17:59,050
How terrifying.

355
00:17:59,310 --> 00:18:01,660
This clever one, start already.

356
00:18:01,920 --> 00:18:03,090
It's already over.

357
00:18:04,880 --> 00:18:05,660
Moon Elder,

358
00:18:05,720 --> 00:18:06,900
he's actually more formidable than you.

359
00:18:07,920 --> 00:18:09,620
Grand Mage, you're insulting me!

360
00:18:10,480 --> 00:18:11,570
Well, in that case,

361
00:18:12,480 --> 00:18:13,860
let me try.

362
00:18:13,880 --> 00:18:14,730
Look!

363
00:18:15,640 --> 00:18:17,570
He bested the Demon Emperor

364
00:18:17,680 --> 00:18:19,860
and saved the Six Clans.

365
00:18:21,070 --> 00:18:22,620
Though often carefree,

366
00:18:22,640 --> 00:18:24,180
when the moment counts,

367
00:18:24,200 --> 00:18:26,570
his noble bearing appears,

368
00:18:26,680 --> 00:18:28,620
with mighty power.

369
00:18:50,880 --> 00:18:51,660
I...

370
00:18:57,480 --> 00:18:58,460
What's wrong with my arm?

371
00:18:58,790 --> 00:18:59,570
My arm...

372
00:19:00,550 --> 00:19:01,330
Senior.

373
00:19:01,680 --> 00:19:02,570
Are you all right?

374
00:19:03,720 --> 00:19:05,380
I'm fine.

375
00:19:06,720 --> 00:19:07,770
Are you truly fine?

376
00:19:08,880 --> 00:19:09,900
I really am.

377
00:19:10,160 --> 00:19:10,790
- Truly?
- Senior.

378
00:19:10,790 --> 00:19:12,100
- I'm fine.
- Let me look.

379
00:19:12,120 --> 00:19:12,860
- I'm fine.
- What of your arm?

380
00:19:12,880 --> 00:19:13,450
- I'm fine.
- What of your arm?

381
00:19:13,470 --> 00:19:13,730
Senior.

382
00:19:13,750 --> 00:19:14,210
I'm fine.

383
00:19:14,230 --> 00:19:14,860
Let me see.

384
00:19:14,880 --> 00:19:15,370
- I'm fine.
- Senior.

385
00:19:15,390 --> 00:19:16,410
- Your arm?
- Senior.

386
00:19:16,410 --> 00:19:17,560
You look far from fine.

387
00:19:17,560 --> 00:19:18,020
I'm truly fine.

388
00:19:18,040 --> 00:19:19,020
- Are you sure?
- I am.

389
00:19:19,040 --> 00:19:20,130
Something's wrong with your arm.

390
00:19:20,150 --> 00:19:20,820
My arm is fine.

391
00:19:20,840 --> 00:19:22,020
- Another illusion!
- You're hurt!

392
00:19:22,040 --> 00:19:23,160
- Break!
- Senior, you're hurt!

393
00:19:23,160 --> 00:19:23,660
Senior.

394
00:19:24,230 --> 00:19:24,980
Are you all right?

395
00:19:25,230 --> 00:19:25,890
Senior.

396
00:19:26,200 --> 00:19:27,690
Break! Break!

397
00:19:28,040 --> 00:19:29,340
If I can't break it, then...

398
00:19:30,000 --> 00:19:30,370
Run!

399
00:19:37,480 --> 00:19:39,220
What is he trying to break?

400
00:19:40,480 --> 00:19:42,860
His words are so deep.

401
00:19:44,270 --> 00:19:45,570
Yes, a bit mystical.

402
00:19:46,070 --> 00:19:46,860
So mystical.

403
00:19:49,510 --> 00:19:51,010
Sorry, sorry.

404
00:19:53,680 --> 00:19:54,570
After all,

405
00:19:54,590 --> 00:19:57,010
we were too hasty,

406
00:19:57,480 --> 00:19:59,530
causing that mortal to lose his arm.

407
00:20:00,640 --> 00:20:01,420
No, this won't do.

408
00:20:02,270 --> 00:20:04,570
We must take

409
00:20:05,030 --> 00:20:06,810
our responsibility.

410
00:20:07,030 --> 00:20:08,660
We must apologize to him.

411
00:20:09,550 --> 00:20:10,330
Moon Elder.

412
00:20:14,790 --> 00:20:15,570
Understood.

413
00:20:21,240 --> 00:20:22,810
Stellar Dreamweaver.

414
00:20:23,480 --> 00:20:26,090
Our dream-sending treasure.

415
00:20:26,110 --> 00:20:27,380
He's a mortal,

416
00:20:27,400 --> 00:20:29,010
so he will sleep and rest.

417
00:20:29,030 --> 00:20:30,810
Once this mortal falls asleep,

418
00:20:30,830 --> 00:20:32,860
we'll use the power of the Dreamweaver

419
00:20:33,030 --> 00:20:35,010
to lead him here in his dream.

420
00:20:35,400 --> 00:20:37,380
Then, you can properly apologize to him.

421
00:20:41,640 --> 00:20:42,460
I apologize?

422
00:20:43,160 --> 00:20:43,940
What's wrong?

423
00:20:44,000 --> 00:20:45,140
Then... you?

424
00:20:45,590 --> 00:20:46,380
He?

425
00:20:48,030 --> 00:20:48,860
I apologize?

426
00:20:49,030 --> 00:20:50,140
Of course.

427
00:20:50,880 --> 00:20:52,290
It must be you.

428
00:20:52,310 --> 00:20:53,860
Be sincere.

429
00:20:57,480 --> 00:20:58,250
Got it.

430
00:21:04,200 --> 00:21:05,810
That power is terrifying.

431
00:21:06,880 --> 00:21:09,530
Once in a dream, I'll be defenseless.

432
00:21:12,680 --> 00:21:14,250
I wonder which great deity it is,

433
00:21:14,270 --> 00:21:15,620
trying to ruin my cultivation.

434
00:21:17,440 --> 00:21:19,460
But I've planned for years.

435
00:21:19,480 --> 00:21:21,460
I can't let it all fall apart here.

436
00:21:23,720 --> 00:21:24,620
At worst,

437
00:21:26,310 --> 00:21:27,530
I just won't sleep.

438
00:21:27,980 --> 00:21:30,920
[Half a month later]

439
00:21:30,920 --> 00:21:31,730
Eastwood Duke,

440
00:21:32,310 --> 00:21:34,250
it's been half a month already.

441
00:21:34,680 --> 00:21:36,460
This thing's been dead silent.

442
00:21:36,830 --> 00:21:38,530
Is it broken or something?

443
00:21:40,310 --> 00:21:41,460
What do you know?

444
00:21:42,200 --> 00:21:44,940
You'd fall apart before it does.

445
00:21:47,110 --> 00:21:49,620
As long as this mortal is tired, weak,

446
00:21:49,640 --> 00:21:50,860
dazed, and distracted,

447
00:21:50,880 --> 00:21:52,380
with his mind wavering,

448
00:21:52,440 --> 00:21:54,180
this Stellar Dreamweaver

449
00:21:54,200 --> 00:21:55,940
can drag him into a dream instantly.

450
00:21:57,680 --> 00:21:59,250
But then again,

451
00:21:59,270 --> 00:22:01,010
this mortal is really annoying.

452
00:22:01,480 --> 00:22:03,180
It's already been half a month.

453
00:22:03,200 --> 00:22:05,770
How come he hasn't slackened at all?

454
00:22:05,790 --> 00:22:08,380
Doesn't he get tired living like this?

455
00:22:08,680 --> 00:22:10,530
It's been half a month already.

456
00:22:11,000 --> 00:22:13,010
If we keep putting off this apology,

457
00:22:13,480 --> 00:22:15,050
his arm will be fully healed.

458
00:22:15,440 --> 00:22:17,530
It seems he's not destined
to get an apology.

459
00:22:17,590 --> 00:22:18,860
Not destined? We'll make it destined.

460
00:22:24,110 --> 00:22:26,330
It's the Grand Mage's blunder.

461
00:22:26,480 --> 00:22:28,050
We must handle the aftermath properly.

462
00:22:28,240 --> 00:22:30,220
Otherwise, it'll be our failure.

463
00:22:30,920 --> 00:22:33,050
Whether his arm heals or not,

464
00:22:33,400 --> 00:22:35,530
we must take responsibility.

465
00:22:38,270 --> 00:22:40,010
Alright, I'm tired too.

466
00:22:41,070 --> 00:22:42,010
I need to go back and sleep.

467
00:22:42,110 --> 00:22:43,980
No, I need to go
sort out official duties.

468
00:22:44,440 --> 00:22:45,330
Keep a close watch.

469
00:22:45,400 --> 00:22:46,860
Watch until he loosens up.

470
00:22:49,030 --> 00:22:50,180
Goodbye, Eastwood Duke.

471
00:22:50,200 --> 00:22:50,980
I'll keep watch.

472
00:22:52,200 --> 00:22:53,460
This place is called Tiger's Mouth.

473
00:22:53,680 --> 00:22:55,620
If you're too sleepy to bear it,

474
00:22:55,640 --> 00:22:57,620
just pinch yourself a couple of times.

475
00:22:57,640 --> 00:22:58,490
Pinch hard.

476
00:22:58,510 --> 00:22:59,700
Ow! Ow!

477
00:23:00,270 --> 00:23:02,460
Don't worry. I'll keep a good watch.

478
00:23:03,070 --> 00:23:03,980
Rest assured.

479
00:23:04,640 --> 00:23:05,770
I'm wide awake.

480
00:23:08,700 --> 00:23:11,860
[Hall of United Spirits]

481
00:23:50,550 --> 00:23:52,380
I'm a cultivator.

482
00:23:52,880 --> 00:23:54,530
With my Qi going on,

483
00:23:55,030 --> 00:23:58,290
staying awake for years is nothing.

484
00:24:02,270 --> 00:24:03,660
Chattering in the dead of night!

485
00:24:03,680 --> 00:24:05,420
You cultivate, but others need sleep!

486
00:24:05,680 --> 00:24:06,460
Cultivate!

487
00:24:06,550 --> 00:24:07,570
Cultivate some decency!

488
00:24:07,590 --> 00:24:08,810
Have you no decency?

489
00:24:09,000 --> 00:24:09,980
You think I have no temper?

490
00:24:18,350 --> 00:24:19,140
Where is this?

491
00:24:21,000 --> 00:24:21,770
Just now...

492
00:24:33,270 --> 00:24:35,090
I've persevered for so long.

493
00:24:35,680 --> 00:24:36,940
How can I quit halfway?

494
00:24:39,030 --> 00:24:40,860
All sensual obstructions, break!

495
00:24:40,880 --> 00:24:41,620
Young man.

496
00:24:42,110 --> 00:24:42,810
Hold on!

497
00:24:42,830 --> 00:24:43,770
Young man, hold on!

498
00:24:43,790 --> 00:24:44,420
What the...?

499
00:24:44,440 --> 00:24:44,810
Young man.

500
00:24:44,830 --> 00:24:45,570
You... you...

501
00:24:45,680 --> 00:24:46,250
Young man.

502
00:24:46,880 --> 00:24:48,250
I've been waiting for you.

503
00:24:48,720 --> 00:24:49,570
Come, come, young man.

504
00:24:49,590 --> 00:24:50,050
What are you doing?

505
00:24:50,070 --> 00:24:51,330
Young man.

506
00:24:51,550 --> 00:24:52,700
Just look over here.

507
00:24:53,830 --> 00:24:54,570
Look here.

508
00:24:56,680 --> 00:24:57,180
Where is this?

509
00:24:58,000 --> 00:25:00,620
Red threads have no end,
yet flowers have masters.

510
00:25:01,030 --> 00:25:04,290
Love never ages;
the moon is forever round.

511
00:25:09,640 --> 00:25:10,620
Could this be...

512
00:25:10,750 --> 00:25:11,420
Exactly.

513
00:25:11,480 --> 00:25:14,660
Under a full moon,
beneath the Tree of Yearning,

514
00:25:14,680 --> 00:25:17,050
this is the Union Palace.

515
00:25:17,240 --> 00:25:19,050
I am the Moon Elder.

516
00:25:19,070 --> 00:25:22,810
Heaven decrees:
I rule Three Realms' marriages.

517
00:25:23,400 --> 00:25:24,220
Young man,

518
00:25:24,790 --> 00:25:28,010
I've long admired you from afar.

519
00:25:30,640 --> 00:25:32,370
Is my intro that moving?

520
00:25:32,390 --> 00:25:35,980
I love this sky so deeply.

521
00:25:37,150 --> 00:25:38,260
There, there, good kid. Don't cry.

522
00:25:38,280 --> 00:25:39,210
There, there.

523
00:25:39,720 --> 00:25:40,650
Don't cry.

524
00:25:43,480 --> 00:25:45,090
That's what happened.

525
00:25:45,920 --> 00:25:49,010
You're so selfless and magnanimous.

526
00:25:49,750 --> 00:25:50,700
[Li Changshou]
That's truly rare.

527
00:25:52,440 --> 00:25:53,420
It's fine.

528
00:25:54,880 --> 00:25:57,460
When others waste their time

529
00:25:57,480 --> 00:25:59,010
on idle thoughts,

530
00:25:59,030 --> 00:26:00,860
I put my time into cultivation.

531
00:26:01,200 --> 00:26:04,010
Since we know
your determination in cultivation,

532
00:26:04,240 --> 00:26:06,530
we won't press you.

533
00:26:07,350 --> 00:26:10,010
As for the Grand Mage of Voidcity,

534
00:26:10,440 --> 00:26:11,900
he won't mind

535
00:26:12,240 --> 00:26:13,490
such trifles.

536
00:26:14,880 --> 00:26:17,090
This involves the Grand Mage too?

537
00:26:17,110 --> 00:26:18,570
More than just involved.

538
00:26:18,640 --> 00:26:20,940
It's like tangled lotus roots.

539
00:26:20,960 --> 00:26:22,050
He's the real breaker

540
00:26:22,070 --> 00:26:22,490
of your...

541
00:26:25,680 --> 00:26:26,660
I didn't hear that. Understood.

542
00:26:26,750 --> 00:26:28,700
Well, the Celestial Court

543
00:26:28,830 --> 00:26:29,620
is newly founded.

544
00:26:30,110 --> 00:26:31,700
The Grand Mage of Voidcity
is a high immortal.

545
00:26:31,720 --> 00:26:33,460
It's only proper for him

546
00:26:33,480 --> 00:26:34,420
to tend to daily affairs.

547
00:26:34,440 --> 00:26:35,420
Of course, of course.

548
00:26:36,270 --> 00:26:37,770
I'll be honest with you.

549
00:26:38,400 --> 00:26:40,460
Since childhood,
I've longed for the Celestial Court.

550
00:26:40,750 --> 00:26:42,810
Now, to actually be here

551
00:26:42,830 --> 00:26:44,460
is truly a dream come true.

552
00:26:44,480 --> 00:26:45,770
I never imagined

553
00:26:45,830 --> 00:26:47,810
that our humble Celestial Court

554
00:26:48,070 --> 00:26:50,140
would have such a devoted admirer.

555
00:26:50,880 --> 00:26:53,810
Why not stay for a drink?

556
00:26:53,830 --> 00:26:55,730
I can tell you something
about the Celestial Court.

557
00:26:56,350 --> 00:26:57,330
Well...

558
00:26:58,030 --> 00:26:59,330
A little drink.

559
00:26:59,550 --> 00:27:00,330
Just a little drink.

560
00:27:01,240 --> 00:27:01,900
Then,

561
00:27:03,830 --> 00:27:04,810
let's have a little drink.

562
00:27:15,960 --> 00:27:17,620
Let me tell you, Changshou.

563
00:27:18,240 --> 00:27:19,730
I'm having such a hard time.

564
00:27:20,270 --> 00:27:22,490
I've been on duty here
for thousands of years.

565
00:27:22,510 --> 00:27:25,010
I haven't had a single day off.

566
00:27:25,030 --> 00:27:26,140
And they'd even have you

567
00:27:26,160 --> 00:27:28,570
work 24 hours a day.

568
00:27:28,590 --> 00:27:30,140
Not even a stick of incense's rest.

569
00:27:30,960 --> 00:27:33,900
The quota for the Book
of Marriages is so high.

570
00:27:33,920 --> 00:27:36,530
How can a little old man like me
finish it all?

571
00:27:36,790 --> 00:27:38,460
And if you can't finish,
you'll be punished.

572
00:27:38,510 --> 00:27:39,730
He never stops to think

573
00:27:39,750 --> 00:27:41,220
how absurd those quotas are, right?

574
00:27:41,240 --> 00:27:42,010
Also,

575
00:27:42,240 --> 00:27:43,810
nowadays,

576
00:27:43,830 --> 00:27:45,700
why do you mortals stop falling in love?

577
00:27:45,750 --> 00:27:48,010
Well, work and life pressure is huge.

578
00:27:48,030 --> 00:27:49,330
There's just no time.

579
00:27:49,350 --> 00:27:51,090
No time?

580
00:27:51,110 --> 00:27:52,220
If you don't fall in love,

581
00:27:52,240 --> 00:27:54,490
I just can't meet my matchmaking quota.

582
00:27:54,510 --> 00:27:55,860
If I can't meet my quota,

583
00:27:55,880 --> 00:27:58,220
Eastwood Duke will really scold me.

584
00:27:58,830 --> 00:27:59,620
Why don't you

585
00:27:59,640 --> 00:28:02,250
just fall in love, huh?

586
00:28:02,590 --> 00:28:05,220
Alright, I understand.

587
00:28:05,240 --> 00:28:06,220
I get you.

588
00:28:06,340 --> 00:28:06,730
Here.

589
00:28:12,030 --> 00:28:12,700
However,

590
00:28:13,640 --> 00:28:15,220
speaking of which, Changshou,

591
00:28:16,830 --> 00:28:18,810
I've been in the Celestial Court
for ages.

592
00:28:19,160 --> 00:28:22,180
This is the first time
someone's had a drink

593
00:28:22,200 --> 00:28:23,490
and chatted with me.

594
00:28:25,640 --> 00:28:26,420
Moon Elder,

595
00:28:27,590 --> 00:28:29,090
as long as you want,

596
00:28:29,720 --> 00:28:33,140
I'll come to your dreams after I sleep

597
00:28:33,160 --> 00:28:34,180
to drink with you.

598
00:28:34,920 --> 00:28:36,860
Don't just come in your dreams.

599
00:28:37,310 --> 00:28:39,940
Take a post at the Celestial Court.

600
00:28:40,200 --> 00:28:42,460
Come work with me.

601
00:28:42,720 --> 00:28:44,570
How fine to drink with me face-to-face.

602
00:28:50,200 --> 00:28:51,220
Moon Elder,

603
00:28:51,750 --> 00:28:53,290
there you go joking again.

604
00:28:53,440 --> 00:28:56,140
The Celestial Court is so lofty.

605
00:28:56,240 --> 00:28:58,380
I'm just a junior.

606
00:28:58,750 --> 00:29:00,050
I dare not dream of it.

607
00:29:00,070 --> 00:29:01,900
Lofty, my foot.

608
00:29:02,590 --> 00:29:04,730
Be it heaven or earth, work is work.

609
00:29:04,750 --> 00:29:05,570
Right?

610
00:29:05,790 --> 00:29:06,460
Let me tell you.

611
00:29:07,240 --> 00:29:08,050
Some affairs

612
00:29:08,640 --> 00:29:10,860
are beyond the control

613
00:29:11,030 --> 00:29:13,220
of the Celestial Court.

614
00:29:13,240 --> 00:29:14,050
Why?

615
00:29:14,160 --> 00:29:15,010
It lacks hands.

616
00:29:15,030 --> 00:29:16,900
There's too much to oversee.

617
00:29:16,920 --> 00:29:18,420
So, it simply can't manage.

618
00:29:19,030 --> 00:29:19,570
Well,

619
00:29:20,310 --> 00:29:22,420
may I ask

620
00:29:22,720 --> 00:29:23,620
one thing?

621
00:29:24,030 --> 00:29:27,860
What does the Celestial Court
want to control?

622
00:29:27,880 --> 00:29:30,090
It wants to control a lot of things.

623
00:29:30,110 --> 00:29:32,730
For example, Eastwood Duke

624
00:29:33,440 --> 00:29:34,770
has recently been worried
about one person.

625
00:29:34,790 --> 00:29:35,490
Tell me about it.

626
00:29:36,030 --> 00:29:36,810
Go on.

627
00:29:36,920 --> 00:29:37,940
She's called

628
00:29:38,590 --> 00:29:39,770
Fairy Yunxiao.

629
00:29:41,440 --> 00:29:42,490
Fairy Yunxiao?

630
00:29:43,590 --> 00:29:44,460
You know her?

631
00:29:45,960 --> 00:29:46,860
No.

632
00:29:46,880 --> 00:29:48,900
How could I possibly know an immortal?

633
00:29:49,240 --> 00:29:50,140
Exactly.

634
00:29:50,200 --> 00:29:53,220
Fairy Yunxiao is so high above.

635
00:29:53,310 --> 00:29:57,860
How could a Human Clan disciple
know her?

636
00:29:57,880 --> 00:29:58,570
Yes.

637
00:29:59,310 --> 00:30:02,250
Then, tell me.

638
00:30:03,110 --> 00:30:06,220
What is Fairy Yunxiao's background?

639
00:30:07,160 --> 00:30:08,530
Let me tell you

640
00:30:09,110 --> 00:30:11,660
about Fairy Yunxiao's

641
00:30:13,070 --> 00:30:14,980
background.

642
00:30:15,070 --> 00:30:17,050
Fairy Yunxiao

643
00:30:17,680 --> 00:30:21,810
is the first cloud given form.

644
00:30:22,880 --> 00:30:26,140
She was born a Quasi-Saint.

645
00:30:26,440 --> 00:30:29,140
Then she joined the Seizing Sect

646
00:30:29,160 --> 00:30:30,940
under Heavenreach Master,

647
00:30:31,200 --> 00:30:34,900
known as the mightiest war goddess.

648
00:30:36,510 --> 00:30:37,620
At first,

649
00:30:37,830 --> 00:30:41,620
Fairy Yunxiao never fought for anything.

650
00:30:41,830 --> 00:30:44,180
But for some reason,

651
00:30:44,200 --> 00:30:47,570
she's become a different person.

652
00:30:47,590 --> 00:30:50,860
She roams around plundering

653
00:30:50,960 --> 00:30:53,620
magic instruments.

654
00:30:53,640 --> 00:30:55,980
A lovely young girl,

655
00:30:56,270 --> 00:30:58,940
now a wicked fiend.

656
00:31:00,830 --> 00:31:01,660
Yunxiao!

657
00:31:03,440 --> 00:31:04,220
Yunxiao!

658
00:31:05,510 --> 00:31:06,290
Yunxiao!

659
00:31:07,920 --> 00:31:08,660
Senior,

660
00:31:08,680 --> 00:31:10,090
is Yunxiao back?

661
00:31:10,160 --> 00:31:11,810
She was just here.

662
00:31:12,310 --> 00:31:14,290
All these years, not a word.

663
00:31:14,290 --> 00:31:16,480
[Zhao Gongming, Seizing Sect]

664
00:31:16,480 --> 00:31:17,570
Where did she go?

665
00:31:19,440 --> 00:31:21,490
She could at least have told us.

666
00:31:25,440 --> 00:31:26,940
I see.

667
00:31:27,400 --> 00:31:28,980
No wonder she's so formidable.

668
00:31:29,070 --> 00:31:31,570
At first, the Celestial Court wanted

669
00:31:32,240 --> 00:31:33,140
to curb her actions.

670
00:31:33,960 --> 00:31:36,420
But Fairy Yunxiao

671
00:31:36,680 --> 00:31:38,620
is elusive.

672
00:31:38,640 --> 00:31:39,420
We can't find her.

673
00:31:39,440 --> 00:31:41,420
Besides, she's too powerful.

674
00:31:41,440 --> 00:31:42,330
She can't be tamed.

675
00:31:44,200 --> 00:31:45,980
So, the Celestial Court let it be.

676
00:31:46,270 --> 00:31:49,180
But something's happened recently.

677
00:31:49,400 --> 00:31:51,940
The Celestial Court had to act.

678
00:31:56,480 --> 00:31:57,460
Recently,

679
00:31:58,440 --> 00:31:59,660
Fairy Yunxiao

680
00:32:00,920 --> 00:32:03,090
has been searching

681
00:32:04,110 --> 00:32:06,180
for the Sea-Calming Pillar.

682
00:32:06,720 --> 00:32:07,900
The Sea-Calming Pillar?

683
00:32:08,240 --> 00:32:09,620
Isn't that the Golden Cudgel?

684
00:32:11,000 --> 00:32:11,770
What cudgel?

685
00:32:12,160 --> 00:32:12,940
Who's great?

686
00:32:12,960 --> 00:32:13,730
You're great.

687
00:32:14,030 --> 00:32:14,980
You misheard.

688
00:32:15,640 --> 00:32:17,770
You might not know

689
00:32:17,790 --> 00:32:19,380
about the Sea-Calming Pillar.

690
00:32:20,110 --> 00:32:24,010
It was here before Pangu

691
00:32:24,030 --> 00:32:25,010
created the world.

692
00:32:25,310 --> 00:32:26,770
Even now, no one knows

693
00:32:26,790 --> 00:32:29,220
where the Sea-Calming Pillar
actually is.

694
00:32:30,240 --> 00:32:32,050
In all the Three Realms,

695
00:32:32,070 --> 00:32:34,330
fewer than ten know.

696
00:32:35,160 --> 00:32:36,620
Shouldn't it be in the East Sea?

697
00:32:39,030 --> 00:32:39,810
You know?

698
00:32:42,440 --> 00:32:43,460
I guessed.

699
00:32:44,590 --> 00:32:45,620
Don't you know?

700
00:32:45,640 --> 00:32:46,220
You...

701
00:32:46,240 --> 00:32:47,420
How would I know?

702
00:32:47,790 --> 00:32:49,380
Do I look like someone

703
00:32:49,590 --> 00:32:51,090
ranked in the top ten

704
00:32:51,510 --> 00:32:52,980
of the Three Realms?

705
00:32:53,000 --> 00:32:54,220
Why wouldn't you?

706
00:32:54,790 --> 00:32:55,940
To me, you seem

707
00:32:55,960 --> 00:32:57,530
more like the top three.

708
00:32:59,790 --> 00:33:01,140
You sweet-talker.

709
00:33:06,640 --> 00:33:07,180
Moon Elder.

710
00:33:08,030 --> 00:33:08,570
Well.

711
00:33:09,640 --> 00:33:10,860
Let me boldly ask

712
00:33:11,240 --> 00:33:14,050
another question.

713
00:33:14,790 --> 00:33:17,140
If I

714
00:33:18,440 --> 00:33:22,700
help the Celestial Court

715
00:33:23,240 --> 00:33:24,620
settle this Fairy Yunxiao matter,

716
00:33:24,720 --> 00:33:26,420
would the Celestial Court then

717
00:33:26,920 --> 00:33:27,940
notice me?

718
00:33:30,240 --> 00:33:31,090
You're drunk.

719
00:33:31,720 --> 00:33:32,460
Just kidding.

720
00:33:32,480 --> 00:33:34,290
Starting to brag, huh?

721
00:33:34,640 --> 00:33:38,380
If you can handle Fairy Yunxiao,

722
00:33:38,640 --> 00:33:41,330
forget about working for me.

723
00:33:41,640 --> 00:33:43,770
You'll just become a high immortal.

724
00:33:44,640 --> 00:33:47,050
You'll be my boss.

725
00:33:47,880 --> 00:33:49,010
My boss...

726
00:33:54,000 --> 00:33:54,770
My boss.

727
00:34:10,000 --> 00:34:12,610
Thirty years of effort finally paid off.

728
00:34:12,630 --> 00:34:14,380
The road ahead is bright.

729
00:34:14,630 --> 00:34:16,340
Now, I just need to head
to the East Sea,

730
00:34:16,360 --> 00:34:17,980
find the Sea-Calming Pillar,
and guard it.

731
00:34:18,000 --> 00:34:20,650
Then, I'll rise to the top.

732
00:34:23,360 --> 00:34:24,130
What's this?

733
00:34:25,590 --> 00:34:26,460
The Tribulation Cloud?

734
00:34:27,760 --> 00:34:28,530
Could it be

735
00:34:29,070 --> 00:34:30,690
Mentor's Tribulation Cloud?

736
00:34:37,150 --> 00:34:39,050
Why are there such dark clouds

737
00:34:39,070 --> 00:34:41,050
gathering above our sect?

738
00:34:41,070 --> 00:34:42,170
Who's facing the Tribulation?

739
00:34:43,960 --> 00:34:44,820
Could it be

740
00:34:45,150 --> 00:34:47,300
someone's facing the Tribulation?

741
00:34:48,760 --> 00:34:49,570
Here, Mentor.

742
00:34:49,800 --> 00:34:51,050
You need all this.

743
00:34:51,710 --> 00:34:52,490
Here.

744
00:34:53,110 --> 00:34:54,130
Put them all here.

745
00:34:55,000 --> 00:34:55,690
Senior,

746
00:34:55,710 --> 00:34:57,860
why not let Mentor face it
in Jade Division?

747
00:34:57,880 --> 00:34:59,490
The Griefbane Division is
the sect's main division.

748
00:34:59,510 --> 00:35:01,490
Outside, the Protective Array
will activate.

749
00:35:01,510 --> 00:35:02,980
Maybe it can reduce
the lightning's impact.

750
00:35:03,000 --> 00:35:03,420
Alright, alright.

751
00:35:04,190 --> 00:35:04,820
Here, Mentor.

752
00:35:05,590 --> 00:35:05,860
Here.

753
00:35:05,880 --> 00:35:06,900
Here, Mentor, take this.

754
00:35:07,440 --> 00:35:08,860
Take this Settlebreath Pill.

755
00:35:09,590 --> 00:35:11,420
And the Jadevoid Powder,
Dragon-Tiger Potion.

756
00:35:11,440 --> 00:35:12,170
Primordial Pill.

757
00:35:12,190 --> 00:35:12,820
Open up.

758
00:35:12,920 --> 00:35:14,210
This is a Lightning Rod.

759
00:35:14,230 --> 00:35:15,210
According to research,

760
00:35:15,230 --> 00:35:16,650
Thunderfall Wood can weaken

761
00:35:16,670 --> 00:35:17,610
the Tribulation by 36%.

762
00:35:17,630 --> 00:35:18,820
Take the Settlebreath Pill now.

763
00:35:19,000 --> 00:35:19,460
Right.

764
00:35:20,800 --> 00:35:21,780
Hurry, open wide, Mentor.

765
00:35:22,280 --> 00:35:24,010
Chew, chew. Yes, yes.

766
00:35:24,630 --> 00:35:26,610
What are you doing to me?

767
00:35:26,920 --> 00:35:28,300
Helping you survive the Tribulation!

768
00:35:36,630 --> 00:35:37,460
Despite all our planning,

769
00:35:37,480 --> 00:35:39,530
your Tribulation Clouds came so soon.

770
00:35:39,550 --> 00:35:41,610
Good thing we were well-prepared.

771
00:35:44,150 --> 00:35:45,300
Mentor, don't worry.

772
00:35:45,320 --> 00:35:46,490
These items on you

773
00:35:46,510 --> 00:35:47,740
will shield you
from five lightning strikes.

774
00:35:47,760 --> 00:35:49,380
- Yes, and this.
- I got a birdcage too.

775
00:35:49,400 --> 00:35:49,820
At worst...

776
00:35:49,840 --> 00:35:51,460
Are you the mentor, or am I?

777
00:35:54,480 --> 00:35:54,980
Mentor...

778
00:35:55,280 --> 00:35:55,860
Mentor...

779
00:35:59,960 --> 00:36:01,860
I know you're worried about me.

780
00:36:02,960 --> 00:36:04,570
I understand your intentions.

781
00:36:05,230 --> 00:36:07,170
But the Tribulation is a pivotal trial.

782
00:36:09,280 --> 00:36:11,090
I must endure it with my body

783
00:36:11,840 --> 00:36:14,090
to bear each bolt of thunder.

784
00:36:15,110 --> 00:36:16,820
Only then can I gain Fate's recognition.

785
00:36:17,710 --> 00:36:20,780
Only then can I say

786
00:36:22,480 --> 00:36:24,490
that I am a true cultivator.

787
00:36:25,030 --> 00:36:25,940
But Mentor...

788
00:36:25,960 --> 00:36:26,570
I know.

789
00:36:28,670 --> 00:36:29,940
I know you are afraid.

790
00:36:31,550 --> 00:36:32,690
I'm afraid too.

791
00:36:35,280 --> 00:36:36,490
When thunder strikes,

792
00:36:38,710 --> 00:36:39,940
my end will be decided.

793
00:36:43,110 --> 00:36:45,090
I'm not afraid of failing the trial.

794
00:36:46,590 --> 00:36:47,570
I'm afraid of...

795
00:36:51,400 --> 00:36:54,210
I'm afraid that if I never return,

796
00:36:59,280 --> 00:37:01,820
how you two rascals

797
00:37:03,630 --> 00:37:05,420
will carry on alone.

798
00:37:10,230 --> 00:37:11,010
Mentor.

799
00:37:15,070 --> 00:37:17,090
Whether I live or die,

800
00:37:17,960 --> 00:37:19,260
it is all the heavenly mandate.

801
00:37:20,800 --> 00:37:22,780
We must face the heavenly mandate,

802
00:37:23,320 --> 00:37:25,260
instead of resorting to heterodox ways.

803
00:37:27,320 --> 00:37:30,860
This is a cultivator's righteous heart.

804
00:37:32,920 --> 00:37:34,380
This is also

805
00:37:35,590 --> 00:37:37,210
my final lesson for you.

806
00:37:38,800 --> 00:37:39,570
Changshou.

807
00:37:39,880 --> 00:37:40,650
I'm here.

808
00:37:40,840 --> 00:37:42,300
Take good care of your junior.

809
00:37:43,840 --> 00:37:45,340
Don't let her suffer again.

810
00:37:47,480 --> 00:37:49,780
I'll be back soon.

811
00:37:50,510 --> 00:37:51,650
If I don't return,

812
00:37:53,840 --> 00:37:55,050
on festive days,

813
00:37:56,030 --> 00:37:57,900
light a stick of incense for me.

814
00:38:00,840 --> 00:38:04,170
When the incense burns out
and smoke curls,

815
00:38:07,510 --> 00:38:09,530
it's me coming to see you.

816
00:38:10,480 --> 00:38:11,300
Mentor,

817
00:38:14,280 --> 00:38:15,340
I obey.

818
00:38:21,760 --> 00:38:23,690
Kids, look.

819
00:38:26,440 --> 00:38:27,740
I never thought

820
00:38:28,710 --> 00:38:31,050
my Tribulation Cloud

821
00:38:31,230 --> 00:38:33,860
would be magnificent.

822
00:38:35,610 --> 00:38:37,360
♪I know the world's full of deceit♪

823
00:38:37,360 --> 00:38:38,130
Mentor.

824
00:38:38,130 --> 00:38:40,180
♪Put on a good show♪

825
00:38:40,620 --> 00:38:45,250
♪Why not change forms and play♪

826
00:38:45,810 --> 00:38:48,000
♪I wish to view the world as art♪

827
00:38:48,000 --> 00:38:50,190
♪But the years are full of chaos♪

828
00:38:50,490 --> 00:38:54,830
♪Caught in karma, stained by dust♪

829
00:38:55,800 --> 00:38:58,090
Whether I'm alive or dead,

830
00:38:58,840 --> 00:39:00,490
whether I make it or not,

831
00:39:01,840 --> 00:39:03,210
today,

832
00:39:04,400 --> 00:39:06,490
I'll accept it all calmly.

833
00:39:09,040 --> 00:39:11,120
♪Let them all come♪

834
00:39:11,120 --> 00:39:15,140
♪There's a perfect plan for everything♪

835
00:39:15,340 --> 00:39:17,290
♪Who's clamoring behind♪

836
00:39:18,000 --> 00:39:20,020
♪Acting like fierce demons♪

837
00:39:21,320 --> 00:39:23,610
Strike!

838
00:39:24,550 --> 00:39:26,860
Come on!

839
00:39:32,400 --> 00:39:34,490
Strike!

840
00:39:35,840 --> 00:39:39,260
Come on!

841
00:39:53,630 --> 00:39:56,460
Come on!

842
00:39:57,400 --> 00:39:58,300
Well.

843
00:39:58,800 --> 00:40:00,820
I'm the Turtle Minister of the East Sea,

844
00:40:01,030 --> 00:40:03,420
here to convey the Dragon King's decree.

845
00:40:03,440 --> 00:40:04,610
I'm here to...

846
00:40:05,360 --> 00:40:06,260
Well...

847
00:40:19,070 --> 00:40:20,860
This is the Human Clan's etiquette?

848
00:40:21,320 --> 00:40:22,090
Understood.

849
00:41:12,110 --> 00:41:13,420
The snow stopped.

850
00:41:19,150 --> 00:41:20,900
You don't understand.

851
00:41:27,480 --> 00:41:29,210
It's been so long since we last met.

852
00:41:30,000 --> 00:41:32,460
The Human Clan is so polite.

853
00:41:32,590 --> 00:41:35,210
It warms my heart.

854
00:41:45,070 --> 00:41:46,980
This is the Ascendance Sect?

855
00:41:49,800 --> 00:41:50,570
What are

856
00:41:52,150 --> 00:41:53,210
all these things?

857
00:41:53,630 --> 00:41:54,420
Your Highness,

858
00:41:55,320 --> 00:41:56,380
they're humans.

859
00:41:58,880 --> 00:42:01,010
So this is

860
00:42:01,920 --> 00:42:02,690
human.

861
00:42:05,880 --> 00:42:09,610
